      "watch_out": "The model holds OpEx flat at $80K/mo while the founder's stated burn is $120K/mo — a $40K/mo gap that implies headcount or costs not modelled. Investors will ask where the extra spend goes."
    },
    "unit_economics": {
      "callout": "75% gross margin is strong for seed-stage SaaS; burn multiple of 2.14 is acceptable but will need to improve as the round size grows.",
      "watch_out": "CAC is entirely absent from the model. Without it, LTV/CAC, payback period, and sales efficiency are all unrateable — these are the metrics investors probe hardest at seed."
    }
  }
}

